NAME
    gcloud beta observability settings - manage Observability settings

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta observability settings COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Observability settings.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Show details of Observability settings on a resource.

     update
        (BETA) Update Observability settings configured on a project, folder,
        or organization.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice.

